[00:00.19]1. Our Sov’reign Lord Jehovah
[00:00.38]Is zealous for his holy name.
[00:06.81]He fervently desires
[00:13.24]To clear it from unrighteous blame.
[00:26.20]Through many generations,
[00:31.20]Great endurance he has shown;
[00:36.20]In loving, kindly patience,
[00:42.20]Not weary has he grown.
[00:49.15]His will is that salvation
[00:54.55]All sorts of people might attain.
[00:59.05]Long-lasting, loving patience
[01:07.45]By God will not have been in vain.
[01:20.44]2. The quality of patience
[01:25.44]Will help us on our godly path.
[01:30.44]It lets our heart be tranquil,
[01:34.94]Protects us from unrighteous wrath.
[01:40.06]It finds the good in others,
[01:45.06]Always hoping for the best.
[01:50.06]It helps us keep our balance
[01:54.56]In times when we’re distressed.
[01:59.68]Along with other virtues
[02:09.68]That holy spirit can bestow,
[02:14.18]Our patience will assist us
[02:22.17]To imitate the God we know.